    "title": "'Chunky Dunker' gets nearly 6 years in prison after police find rifle, meth at his feet - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sarah Motter ,\n3 hours ago INDEPENDENCE, Mo. (KCTV) - A convicted felon is heading back to prison after Independence Police found a rifle at his feet and meth within reach. The U.S. Attorney’s Office for the Western District of Missouri announced on Wednesday, March 4, that Dustin E. Talbott, 41, was sentenced to 71 months - nearly 6 years - in federal prison. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
